{"id":"msg_m_ex_maxwell_06","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_maxwell","label":"Maxwell · Nikke"},"label":"6. Ugh...","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_maxwell_05","next":"msg_m_ex_maxwell_mechanic_01","speakers":{"maxwell":"Maxwell"},"icons":{"maxwell":"si_c102_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_1","text":"Ugh...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_2","text":"Cutey, help.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_3","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_3","text":"Is it Laplace again?","jump":"m_ex_maxwell_06_5"},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_4","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_4","text":"Is it Drake again?","jump":"m_ex_maxwell_06_7"},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_5","text":"Correct.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_6","text":"She did it again.","jump":"m_ex_maxwell_06_9"},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_7","text":"Surprisingly, no.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_8","text":"It's the other one this time around.","jump":"m_ex_maxwell_06_9"},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_9","text":"Honestly, they're both equally frustrating,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_10","text":"but Laplace is constantly breaking windows left and right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_11","text":"I've begged her countless times to stop, but it's never done any good.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_12","text":"I've had to change my window in the Commander's Room several times already.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_13","text":"I can only imagine.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_14","text":"Normally, I can let her escapades slide,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_15","text":"but this time,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_16","text":"Syuen was on the receiving end of her antics.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_17","text":"How did that come about?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_18","text":"We went to Syuen's office, as we always do, to report in,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_19","text":"and Laplace, being herself,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_20","text":"barged in through the window, going on about a heroic entrance and all that non-sense.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_21","text":"Sounds like quite the scene.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_22","text":"It was.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_23","text":"But what irks me the most is that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_24","text":"I'm the one who caught the most heat for it from Syuen.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_25","text":"She knew right off the bat that Laplace was incorrigible, so instead,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_26","text":"she asked me to make a shatter-proof window.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_27","text":"Were you able to pull it off?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_28","text":"I was.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_29","text":"After swapping out the standard windows in Syuen's office for ones that were shatter-proof,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_30","text":"I thought that would be the end of it, but...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_31","text":"But what?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_32","text":"Laplace ended up getting angry at the window,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_33","text":"since it refused to break,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_34","text":"and kept fighting with it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_35","text":"Yikes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_36","text":"Oh no...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_37","text":"I'm getting a call from Syuen.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_38","text":"Sounds like you're really going through it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maxwell_06_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maxwell_06_39","text":"You can say that again. I'll be back.","jump":null}],"chat":true}